:\"interaction\",\"tags\":[\"robot-ride\"],\"description\":\"Eight authored rider poses from the full card; platform motion belongs to the robot prop.\"}}],\"projectId\":\"sequence-robot-ride\",\"description\":\"Eight authored rider poses from the full card; platform motion belongs to the robot prop.\",\"category\":\"interaction\",\"catalogueRevision\":4,\"oneShot\":false,\"preferredFrame\":0,\"workQueue\":{\"version\":1,\"repository\":\"Stick-Pet-Card\",\"selectedId\":\"vertical-up\",\"tasks\":[{\"id\":\"vertical-up\",\"title\":\"Straight-up jump\",\"category\":\"jump\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"tags\":[\"vertical\",\"up\",\"airborne\"],\"instructions\":\"Create a distinct straight-up airborne pose. Keep the body compact and legs beneath him; avoid the diagonal forward-reaching silhouette. Preserve the intended facing on a vertical jump. Start with one missing airborne frame, using existing takeoff and landing frames as onion references.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"vertical-down\",\"title\":\"Straight-down drop\",\"category\":\"jump\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"tags\":[\"vertical\",\"down\",\"airborne\"],\"instructions\":\"Create a distinct straight-down airborne pose with the feet prepared beneath the body. Preserve facing rather than implying a sideways leap or backwards motion. Start with one missing airborne frame; compare against existing descent preparation and landing crouch.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"look-down\",\"title\":\"Look down from a perch\",\"category\":\"idle\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"tags\":[\"look-down\",\"card-edge\"],\"instructions\":\"Lower the head to inspect a card or landing below. Keep the planted paw cells fixed and allow the body/tail to overhang. Use the sitting/perch frames as references.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"horizontal-refine\",\"title\":\"Refine horizontal leap\",\"category\":\"jump\",\"priority\":\"normal\",\"tags\":[\"horizontal\",\"airborne\"],\"instructions\":\"Refine the approved AI horizontal flight pose. Keep a level back, forward head, trailing tail and gathered legs. Human pixel edits to the AI source make a mixed-origin frame; retain its lineage. No planted contact anchor while airborne.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"walk-head\",\"title\":\"Refine independent walk heads\",\"category\":\"walk\",\"priority\":\"normal\",\"tags\":[\"walk\",\"head-bob\"],\"instructions\":\"Review the high/low head combinations. Improve the head/neck seam if needed while leaving leg frames and every planted paw marker unchanged. Compare original and half-time head bobbing at the same walking speed.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]},{\"id\":\"sitting-glance\",\"title\":\"Sitting head glance\",\"category\":\"idle\",\"priority\":\"later\",\"tags\":[\"sit\",\"look\"],\"instructions\":\"Explore a small head turn toward a nearby object without flipping the whole body. Audit the existing turn/idle catalogue before drawing new pixels; keep bearing paws in their source cells.\",\"status\":\"todo\",\"frameIds\":[],\"notes\":\"\",\"outputs\":[]}]}}}","etag":"e0a75a3ab328cf1d17a6d089e75aef50baa962c5f41f8901c7066a5515fb19b9","customMetadata":{"projectId":"sequence-robot-ride","name":"Riding the robot","savedAt":"2026-10-14T19:45:06.518Z","ready":"0"}}